title: "Open Functional Self Lab"
abstract: >-
  A controlled, sandboxed lab for functional self-models and open-ended research loops:
  unified clock, append-only audit ledger, explicit state machine, hard budget gate,
  red-line scanner, dashboard and weekly reports. Not a claim of consciousness.
